@startuml
title Diagrama General del Sistema

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Cliente

rectangle "Backend monolitico FastAPI" as Backend {
  component "FastAPI app\napp/main.py" as FastAPI
  component "Document Router\n/api/documents" as Router
  component "Health Router\n/health" as Health
  component "DocumentService" as DocumentService
  component "PDFService" as PDFService
  interface "DocumentRepository" as RepositoryContract
  component "MongoDocumentRepository" as Repository
}

database "MongoDB\ncollection: documents" as MongoDB

Cliente --> FastAPI : HTTP request
FastAPI --> Router : endpoints documentos
FastAPI --> Health : health check
Router --> DocumentService : delega casos de uso
DocumentService --> PDFService : extrae texto y checksum\nsolo en POST
DocumentService --> RepositoryContract : usa contrato
Repository ..|> RepositoryContract
Repository --> MongoDB : CRUD documents
Health --> MongoDB : ping admin.command("ping")

note right of Backend
Una sola aplicacion desplegable.
La separacion es por capas internas,
no por servicios distribuidos.
end note

@enduml
